{"meta":{"id":"requests","category":"it/syntax/python/network","title":"requests (동기 통신) · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"requests.get / post, raise_for_status, res.json()","tags":["python","f-network"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">requests (동기 통신) · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> requests.get / post, raise_for_status, res.json()</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">requests (동기)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import requests\r\n\r\nres = requests.get(f&quot;https://api.example.com/users/{id}&quot;, timeout=5)\r\nres.raise_for_status()               # 4xx / 5xx 면 예외 (fetch 는 직접 res.ok 확인)\r\nuser = res.json()                    # dict — 형태는 보장되지 않음\r\n\r\nrequests.post(url, json={&quot;name&quot;: &quot;kim&quot;})</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">응답이 올 때까지 기다리는 동기 호출. 형태 검증은 pydantic 모델 사용</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › fetch 와 응답 타입, Java › HttpClient</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/network/requests","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/python/network"}],"hasImage":false}